ess and other U.S. mortgage reinsurance transactions; and international mortgage insurance and reinsurance business covering loans. It markets its products through a group of licensed independent retail and wholesale brokers. The company was formerly known as Risk Capital Holdings, Inc. Arch Capital Group Ltd. was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Pembroke, Bermuda.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Nicolas Alain Emmanuel Papadopoulo | CEO & Director | Age 63 | Compensation: $7.3M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 8K people. Revenue per employee of $2.5M ranks in the top quartile among Financial Services peers, improving at 13%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $766K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $18K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Arch Capital Group Ltd. is a large-cap financial services business with a $34.9B market cap on $19.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +28% over the past three years and +18% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 21% against a 7% cost of capital \u2014 a 14-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $6.1B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 31 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.40\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 36\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Management returns a meaningful 10.8% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal 